BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tour de Fuzz 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260905T070000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260905T170000
UID:d561311c056124fc36ac6c5491cf371c@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Tour de Fuzz is a fully supported charity bike ride through So
 noma wine country benefiting the Law Enforcement Chaplaincy\, which serves
  Petaluma. Choose 32\, 62\, or 100-mile routes\, then enjoy a finish-line 
 BBQ with local beer and wine. www.tourdefuzz.org
LOCATION:Petaluma\, CA
URL:https://business.petalumachamber.us/events/details/tour-de-fuzz-2026
X-SOURCE:Petaluma Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Petaluma Art & Garden Festival
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260712T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260712T170000
UID:7494e401e47ef53476cd7893b2d9a2bf@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:The 23rd Art & Garden Festival\, one of Petaluma’s most cher
 ished summer traditions\, is a vibrant\, family-friendly celebration of cr
 eativity\, community\, and local flavor\, drawing crowds of over 15\,000 p
 eople to historic downtown Petaluma to enjoy art\, music\, food\, and fun.
  Explore more than 100 handpicked art exhibitors offering unique\, high-qu
 ality\, handmade goods—from garden and home décor to artisan jewelry an
 d fine art. Live music will fill the air from two stages\, while local win
 eries\, breweries\, distilleries\, and restaurants serve up delicious tast
 es of Sonoma County and beyond. Gardening experts will be available to sha
 re tips specific to local needs and conditions. The Children’s Corner fe
 atures jump houses\, face painting\, and free hands-on arts and crafts. Th
 e festival takes place on Kentucky Street\, Fourth Street\, B Street\, and
  the A Street parking lot. Festival Headquarters will be located at the Pe
 taluma Historical Library & Museum Garden Court\, 20 Fourth Street. Admiss
 ion i
LOCATION:Petaluma\, CA
URL:https://business.petalumachamber.us/events/details/petaluma-art-garden
 -festival-07-12-2026
X-SOURCE:Petaluma Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
