BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wet Paint: Art Show with Jonny Hirschmugl
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260723T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260723T200000
UID:24a187acf664829377af7ba1ced7ae94@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:"This showing is a perspective on the retrospective\; sort of.
 " Jonny Hirschmugl is a painter\, builder\, and a main character in this s
 atire of life. In all his creative endeavors\, his main qualities are ever
  present: nostalgic\, romantic\, & delusional. A Petaluma native\, his art
  is influenced by the riverscape story of this town. Buried in the iron fa
 cades of downtown's structures\, to the labyrinth sewers below. And the he
 ritage farmlands\, with forgotten tales\, that only the ravens can recite 
 so well. Jonny has exhibited his paintings in gallery shows and various ma
 rkets for the last 17 years. His murals can be seen throughout Petaluma\, 
 and spanning to nearby places in Sonoma County.
LOCATION:Petaluma\, CA
URL:https://business.petalumachamber.us/events/details/wet-paint-art-show-
 with-jonny-hirschmugl
X-SOURCE:Petaluma Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
